      "content": "13.1 Chhattisgarh Police Act & Structure"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Covers the organizational framework and administrative hierarchy defined under the Chhattisgarh Police Act.",
        "Highlights critical updates introduced by the New Criminal Laws (2024) essential for state police exams.",
        "Details key penal sections comparing Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS) with the former Indian Penal Code (IPC).",
        "Outlines rank structures, badges, and insignias across the police force hierarchy.",
        "Defines core operational responsibilities, investigation duties, and recruitment exam patterns for Sub-Inspectors."
      ],
      "id": "00vtali"
    },
